1
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:20,880
Sun Xiaofei,

2
00:00:20,880 --> 00:00:22,080
wake up! Sun Xiaofei!

3
00:00:22,400 --> 00:00:23,200
I just asked you

4
00:00:23,200 --> 00:00:24,640
to give the female lead role to me.

5
00:00:24,640 --> 00:00:26,300
Don't play dead, Sun Xiaofei.

6
00:00:30,840 --> 00:00:31,280
Help!

7
00:00:31,640 --> 00:00:32,439
Somebody!

8
00:00:32,840 --> 00:00:33,840
Someone's dying!

9
00:00:34,160 --> 00:00:34,890
Sun Xiaofei!

10
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:36,200
Sun Xiaofei, wake up!

11
00:01:30,360 --> 00:01:30,920
Ms. Feifei

12
00:01:30,920 --> 00:01:32,640
is so suited for period costumes.

13
00:01:32,640 --> 00:01:34,240
Absolute female lead vibes.

14
00:01:37,320 --> 00:01:38,200
Later, we can

15
00:01:38,200 --> 00:01:39,600
set up a base light here

16
00:01:39,680 --> 00:01:40,640
and rim it from over there.

17
00:01:40,640 --> 00:01:41,240
Excuse me,

18
00:01:41,600 --> 00:01:42,479
Don't go in. Don't...

19
00:01:42,479 --> 00:01:43,080
This is...

20
00:01:44,840 --> 00:01:45,640
This is the female lead's makeup room.

21
00:01:45,640 --> 00:01:46,970
What are you doing here?

22
00:01:48,640 --> 00:01:49,370
Sun Xiaofei!

23
00:01:49,920 --> 00:01:50,920
And to think I once considered you

24
00:01:50,920 --> 00:01:51,960
my best friend.

25
00:01:52,120 --> 00:01:53,280
But you used such dirty tricks

26
00:01:53,280 --> 00:01:54,210
to steal my role.

27
00:01:55,920 --> 00:01:56,640
Xia Yimo,

28
00:01:57,400 --> 00:01:58,800
watch your mouth.

29
00:01:59,120 --> 00:02:00,360
What do you mean by stealing?

30
00:02:00,360 --> 00:02:01,040
I earned this role

31
00:02:01,040 --> 00:02:02,440
through my own hard work.

32
00:02:03,920 --> 00:02:05,120
You sure worked hard.

33
00:02:05,720 --> 00:02:07,520
Stabbing me in the front wasn't enough,

34
00:02:07,520 --> 00:02:09,320
so you stabbed me in the back too.

35
00:02:12,240 --> 00:02:12,760
What?

36
00:02:13,600 --> 00:02:14,920
Does playing the second lead once

37
00:02:14,920 --> 00:02:16,320
make you feel so wronged?

38
00:02:16,440 --> 00:02:17,320
Or

39
00:02:17,840 --> 00:02:18,700
are you scared?

40
00:02:18,760 --> 00:02:20,560
Scared your acting will be overshadowed?

41
00:02:20,560 --> 00:02:22,090
You think I'm scared of you?

42
00:02:22,320 --> 00:02:23,520
Don't forget who

43
00:02:23,520 --> 00:02:24,880
brought you into the cast
in the first place.

44
00:02:24,880 --> 00:02:25,880
You even need a stand-in

45
00:02:25,880 --> 00:02:27,280
just to shoot a water scene.

46
00:02:27,280 --> 00:02:28,340
I certainly don't.

47
00:02:32,520 --> 00:02:33,120
Perfect.

48
00:02:33,800 --> 00:02:35,480
We have a water scene coming up.

49
00:02:35,480 --> 00:02:37,210
Let's have a fair competition.

50
00:02:38,560 --> 00:02:39,160
All right.

51
00:02:40,560 --> 00:02:41,760
Then I want everyone

52
00:02:42,360 --> 00:02:44,480
to open their eyes and see clearly

53
00:02:45,600 --> 00:02:47,730
who is a better fit for the female lead.

54
00:02:48,000 --> 00:02:49,160
This is so juicy.

55
00:02:49,440 --> 00:02:50,560
Xia Yimo and Sun Xiaofei

56
00:02:50,560 --> 00:02:52,120
are having a catfight on set.

57
00:02:52,120 --> 00:02:54,250
Quick, send it to the gossip accounts.

58
00:03:14,280 --> 00:03:15,340
Why won't this rope

59
00:03:15,360 --> 00:03:16,360
come undone?

60
00:03:23,880 --> 00:03:24,680
Pull me up!

61
00:03:25,120 --> 00:03:25,760
I haven't taken back

62
00:03:25,760 --> 00:03:27,490
my position as the female lead!

63
00:03:41,120 --> 00:03:42,040
Where is this?

64
00:03:43,880 --> 00:03:44,920
Am I dead?

65
00:03:45,960 --> 00:03:47,079
Actress Xia Yimo,

66
00:03:47,600 --> 00:03:48,320
welcome to

67
00:03:48,320 --> 00:03:49,650
Moxian's script world.

68
00:03:49,960 --> 00:03:51,720
I am the product manager, Xuyu.

69
00:03:52,440 --> 00:03:54,320
A script has a product manager?

70
00:03:54,840 --> 00:03:56,040
You have fallen into a coma

71
00:03:56,040 --> 00:03:57,040
in the real world.

72
00:03:57,640 --> 00:03:59,000
You need to play

73
00:03:59,000 --> 00:04:00,000
the corresponding role in the script,

74
00:04:00,000 --> 00:04:01,800
complete the required plot tasks,

75
00:04:01,800 --> 00:04:03,400
and successfully reach the ending

76
00:04:03,400 --> 00:04:04,930
to return to the real world.

77
00:04:05,200 --> 00:04:06,920
Next, I will introduce

78
00:04:06,920 --> 00:04:08,440
the rules for playing the role.

79
00:04:08,440 --> 00:04:10,000
Did I time-travel,

80
00:04:10,600 --> 00:04:12,000
or is this a system novel?

81
00:04:12,520 --> 00:04:13,280
So cliché.

82
00:04:13,400 --> 00:04:14,080
Xia Yimo,

83
00:04:14,320 --> 00:04:15,200
you have a total of five chances

84
00:04:15,200 --> 00:04:16,160
to play.

85
00:04:16,640 --> 00:04:18,040
Simply unroll a scroll

86
00:04:18,519 --> 00:04:20,519
to start your character's journey.

87
00:04:26,520 --> 00:04:28,080
But there's nothing on it.

88
00:04:28,520 --> 00:04:29,880
The answer will only be revealed

89
00:04:29,880 --> 00:04:31,480
when you enter the painting.

90
00:04:32,880 --> 00:04:33,960
After all that talk,

91
00:04:33,960 --> 00:04:34,680
why didn't you just let me in

92
00:04:34,680 --> 00:04:35,810
and get it over with?

93
00:04:36,600 --> 00:04:38,530
The female lead in a costume drama.

94
00:04:38,680 --> 00:04:40,409
I've played it a million times.

95
00:04:40,520 --> 00:04:41,720
I know all the tropes.

96
00:04:41,760 --> 00:04:43,090
Surviving until the end

97
00:04:43,280 --> 00:04:44,540
will be a piece of cake.

98
00:04:45,000 --> 00:04:46,460
Wait, I haven't finished.

99
00:04:50,520 --> 00:04:51,520
I'm not dreaming.

100
00:04:51,880 --> 00:04:53,640
I really transmigrated into the script.

101
00:04:53,640 --> 00:04:55,520
This is the home
of the female lead, Xue Ruowan.

102
00:04:55,520 --> 00:04:56,840
You wretched girl,

103
00:04:57,159 --> 00:04:58,360
slacking off here.

104
00:04:59,080 --> 00:05:00,240
This Xue Ruowan

105
00:05:00,360 --> 00:05:01,890
is indeed a tragic heroine.

106
00:05:02,280 --> 00:05:03,400
Even the servants

107
00:05:03,440 --> 00:05:04,500
don't respect her.

108
00:05:04,760 --> 00:05:05,560
I am

109
00:05:05,600 --> 00:05:07,840
the eldest daughter
of the Duke's estate, after all.

110
00:05:07,840 --> 00:05:08,700
Wretched girl.

111
00:05:09,320 --> 00:05:10,580
Who did you say you are?

112
00:05:11,600 --> 00:05:14,000
Take a good look at yourself
in the mirror.

113
00:05:17,480 --> 00:05:18,440
My face.

114
00:05:20,760 --> 00:05:23,280
Xiaolan, female, 18 years old.

115
00:05:23,400 --> 00:05:24,440
Maid

116
00:05:24,480 --> 00:05:26,080
of the Duke of Ying's estate.

117
00:05:26,080 --> 00:05:27,140
Stop acting crazy.

118
00:05:27,400 --> 00:05:28,360
General Ning sent over

119
00:05:28,360 --> 00:05:29,840
the imperially bestowed wedding dress.

120
00:05:29,840 --> 00:05:31,080
Hurry up and deliver it

121
00:05:31,080 --> 00:05:32,120
to the Young Lady!

122
00:05:36,120 --> 00:05:37,920
So I'm not the female lead.

123
00:05:42,960 --> 00:05:43,720
They

124
00:05:44,320 --> 00:05:45,080
actually

125
00:05:45,920 --> 00:05:47,080
drugged me.

126
00:05:57,960 --> 00:05:59,020
This stupid system

127
00:05:59,560 --> 00:06:01,160
actually made me play a maid.

128
00:06:01,600 --> 00:06:03,130
Playing a maid is one thing,

129
00:06:03,400 --> 00:06:05,060
but even this face isn't mine.

130
00:06:06,920 --> 00:06:09,720
Delivering the wedding dress
to the Young Lady...

131
00:06:10,360 --> 00:06:11,440
I'd like to see

132
00:06:11,840 --> 00:06:13,640
what this Xue Ruowan looks like.

133
00:07:07,960 --> 00:07:08,640
Sorry,

134
00:07:08,760 --> 00:07:09,440
wrong room.

135
00:07:09,840 --> 00:07:11,280
Carry on.

136
00:07:11,560 --> 00:07:12,240
Ning,

137
00:07:12,600 --> 00:07:13,440
we've been seen.

138
00:07:13,440 --> 00:07:14,400
What should we do?

139
00:07:14,400 --> 00:07:15,130
Don't worry.

140
00:07:15,960 --> 00:07:16,840
I won't let this

141
00:07:16,880 --> 00:07:17,560
get out.

142
00:07:18,360 --> 00:07:19,160
After all,

143
00:07:19,800 --> 00:07:21,730
I'm marrying Xue Ruowan tomorrow.

144
00:07:22,680 --> 00:07:24,120
A sex scene right at the start.

145
00:07:24,120 --> 00:07:25,320
What's with

146
00:07:25,320 --> 00:07:25,800
all these steamy scenes?

147
00:07:25,800 --> 00:07:27,530
Just to grab attention, right?

148
00:07:28,960 --> 00:07:30,520
But who was that guy?

149
00:07:31,160 --> 00:07:32,200
Why overthink it?

150
00:07:32,360 --> 00:07:34,620
Finding the female lead is the priority.

151
00:07:55,520 --> 00:07:56,280
Sun Xiaofei!

152
00:07:56,520 --> 00:07:57,580
It's actually you.

153
00:07:58,640 --> 00:07:59,360
Xiaolan,

154
00:07:59,960 --> 00:08:00,880
didn't I tell you

155
00:08:00,880 --> 00:08:02,280
to keep watch outside tonight?

156
00:08:02,280 --> 00:08:03,340
Why did you come in?

157
00:08:03,800 --> 00:08:05,360
You're really playing the female lead.

158
00:08:05,360 --> 00:08:06,920
Did you time-travel here too?

159
00:08:06,920 --> 00:08:08,450
What the hell are you doing?

160
00:08:08,680 --> 00:08:09,880
What nonsense are you talking about?

161
00:08:09,880 --> 00:08:11,240
Stop playing innocent.

162
00:08:11,360 --> 00:08:12,490
Did you do this to me?

163
00:08:12,640 --> 00:08:13,880
Why do you get to be the female lead,

164
00:08:13,880 --> 00:08:14,440
while my face

165
00:08:14,440 --> 00:08:15,800
has turned into this?

166
00:08:15,880 --> 00:08:17,240
Give me my face back!

167
00:08:17,320 --> 00:08:17,880
Sun Xiaofei!

168
00:08:17,880 --> 00:08:18,800
Let go of me!

169
00:08:18,840 --> 00:08:20,160
Sun Xiaofei, let go!

170
00:08:20,440 --> 00:08:21,120
No!

171
00:08:23,000 --> 00:08:23,730
Sun Xiaofei!

172
00:08:23,840 --> 00:08:25,040
Wake up, Sun Xiaofei!

173
00:08:25,440 --> 00:08:26,200
I just wanted you

174
00:08:26,200 --> 00:08:27,600
to give up the female lead role to me.

175
00:08:27,600 --> 00:08:28,320
Don't play dead

176
00:08:28,320 --> 00:08:29,440
on me here.

177
00:08:32,960 --> 00:08:33,720
Help!

178
00:08:33,919 --> 00:08:34,780
Somebody help!

179
00:08:35,120 --> 00:08:36,280
Someone's dying!

180
00:08:36,360 --> 00:08:37,090
Sun Xiaofei!

181
00:08:37,320 --> 00:08:38,520
Sun Xiaofei, wake up!

182
00:09:10,800 --> 00:09:12,200
It was all acting before.

183
00:09:12,760 --> 00:09:14,320
I didn't expect getting stabbed by a sword

184
00:09:14,320 --> 00:09:15,560
to hurt this much.

185
00:09:15,720 --> 00:09:16,800
Actor Xia Yimo,

186
00:09:17,240 --> 00:09:18,000
it's a pity,

187
00:09:18,320 --> 00:09:19,920
your story mission
playing the maid Xiaolan

188
00:09:19,920 --> 00:09:21,360
has failed.

189
00:09:23,720 --> 00:09:24,960
Who wants to play a maid?

190
00:09:24,960 --> 00:09:25,840
I want to be the female lead.

191
00:09:25,840 --> 00:09:27,480
In Moxiang's script world,

192
00:09:27,680 --> 00:09:29,520
the role you play is random.

193
00:09:29,680 --> 00:09:30,880
But the only one you can't play

194
00:09:30,880 --> 00:09:32,160
is the female lead, Xue Ruowan.

195
00:09:32,160 --> 00:09:33,720
Because your story mission

196
00:09:33,760 --> 00:09:35,440
is to protect the female lead's safety.

197
00:09:35,440 --> 00:09:36,400
Random?

198
00:09:37,000 --> 00:09:38,860
Are you drawing blind boxes here?

199
00:09:40,600 --> 00:09:42,600
Sun Xiaofei fought me for the female lead,

200
00:09:42,600 --> 00:09:44,200
and I still have to protect her?

201
00:09:44,200 --> 00:09:44,800
Why?

202
00:09:45,800 --> 00:09:46,640
Here,

203
00:09:46,960 --> 00:09:48,160
you must listen to me.

204
00:09:50,680 --> 00:09:52,600
Are you the client or a bossy CEO?

205
00:09:52,720 --> 00:09:53,450
So arrogant.

206
00:09:53,480 --> 00:09:54,940
Whether you like it or not,

207
00:09:55,040 --> 00:09:55,880
your fate

208
00:09:55,920 --> 00:09:56,960
is tied to the female lead's

209
00:09:56,960 --> 00:09:57,920
fate.

210
00:09:58,200 --> 00:09:58,800
Once Xue Ruowan

211
00:09:58,800 --> 00:10:00,480
falls into a fatal crisis,

212
00:10:00,720 --> 00:10:01,320
it means

213
00:10:01,320 --> 00:10:02,780
your story mission fails.

214
00:10:02,920 --> 00:10:04,160
The role you play,

215
00:10:04,160 --> 00:10:04,600
you and I,

216
00:10:04,600 --> 00:10:05,560
will also die.

217
00:10:05,800 --> 00:10:08,040
You have five chances
to play a role in total.

218
00:10:08,040 --> 00:10:09,880
Now you have four left.

219
00:10:10,120 --> 00:10:10,680
Fine.

220
00:10:10,960 --> 00:10:11,820
I'll endure it.

221
00:10:12,560 --> 00:10:14,160
I'll treat you as the client.

222
00:10:14,440 --> 00:10:15,720
I want to see this time

223
00:10:16,000 --> 00:10:16,520
what kind of role

224
00:10:16,520 --> 00:10:17,580
you arrange for me.

225
00:10:33,520 --> 00:10:33,980
This...

226
00:10:35,120 --> 00:10:36,380
What's with this look?

227
00:10:49,200 --> 00:10:50,160
What the hell?

228
00:10:50,680 --> 00:10:52,200
I transmigrated into a man!
